        <object id="notes" label="&lt;b&gt;Gaps (not drawn):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Production link to the real on-premises accounts system and PO/GRN database (Q9): how will they be reached, and does the real accounts API accept invoice-v1.xsd idempotently? Simulated inside the system for the PoC (AD-10, Deferred).&lt;br&gt;• How does the operator deliver upload links to suppliers? AD-6 says WhatsApp or SMS by hand, outside the system; no channel is part of the architecture.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each element's source is in grey under its name and in its tooltip.">
